ildren"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ComponentChild"},{"type":"text","value":" | ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ComponentChild"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":6,"id":"selector","children":[{"type":"text","value":"selector?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ComponentChildren"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"tonmount","text":"TOnMount","level":3},{"id":"tonchange","text":"TOnChange","level":3},{"id":"tonchangeasync","text":"TOnChangeAsync","level":3},{"id":"tonblur","text":"TOnBlur","level":3},{"id":"tonblurasync","text":"TOnBlurAsync","level":3},{"id":"tonsubmit","text":"TOnSubmit","level":3},{"id":"tonsubmitasync","text":"TOnSubmitAsync","level":3},{"id":"tondynamic","text":"TOnDynamic","level":3},{"id":"tondynamicasync","text":"TOnDynamicAsync","level":3},{"id":"tonserver","text":"TOnServer","level":3},{"id":"tsubmitmeta","text":"TSubmitMeta","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"field","text":"Field","level":3},{"id":"formgroup","text":"FormGroup","level":3},{"id":"subscribe","text":"Subscribe()","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters-2","text":"Type Parameters","level":4},{"id":"tselected","text":"TSelected","level":5},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"props","text":"props","level":5},{"id":"children","text":"children","level":6},{"id":"selector","text":"selector?","level":6},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx:24](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx#L24)\n\nFields that are added onto the `FormAPI` from `@tanstack/form-core` and returned from `useForm`\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\n### TOnMount\n\n`TOnMount` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnChange\n\n`TOnChange` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnChangeAsync\n\n`TOnChangeAsync` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormAsyncValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnBlur\n\n`TOnBlur` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnBlurAsync\n\n`TOnBlurAsync` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormAsyncValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnSubmit\n\n`TOnSubmit` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnSubmitAsync\n\n`TOnSubmitAsync` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormAsyncValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnDynamic\n\n`TOnDynamic` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnDynamicAsync\n\n`TOnDynamicAsync` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormAsyncValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnServer\n\n`TOnServer` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormAsyncValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TSubmitMeta\n\n`TSubmitMeta`\n\n## Properties\n\n### Field\n\n```ts\nField: FieldComponent<TFormData, TOnMount, TOnChange, TOnChangeAsync, TOnBlur, TOnBlurAsync, TOnSubmit, TOnSubmitAsync, TOnDynamic, TOnDynamicAsync, TOnServer, TSubmitMeta>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx:41](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx#L41)\n\nA Preact component to render form fields. With this, you can render and manage individual form fields.\n\n***\n\n### FormGroup\n\n```ts\nFormGroup: FormGroupComponent<TFormData, TOnMount, TOnChange, TOnChangeAsync, TOnBlur, TOnBlurAsync, TOnSubmit, TOnSubmitAsync, TOnDynamic, TOnDynamicAsync, TOnServer, TSubmitMeta>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx:55](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx#L55)\n\n***\n\n### Subscribe()\n\n```ts\nSubscribe: <TSelected>(props) => ComponentChildren;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx:72](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx#L72)\n\nA `Subscribe` function that allows you to listen and react to changes in the form's state. It's especially useful when you need to execute side effects or render specific components in response to state updates.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = `NoInfer`\\<`FormState`\\<`TFormData`, `TOnMount`, `TOnChange`, `TOnChangeAsync`, `TOnBlur`, `TOnBlurAsync`, `TOnSubmit`, `TOnSubmitAsync`, `TOnDynamic`, `TOnDynamicAsync`, `TOnServer`\\>\\>\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### props\n\n###### children\n\n`ComponentChild` \\| (`state`) => `ComponentChild`\n\n###### selector?\n\n(`state`) => `TSelected`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`ComponentChildren`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: PreactFormApi\ntitle: PreactFormApi\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx:24](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx#L24)\n\nFields that are added onto the `FormAPI` from `@tanstack/form-core` and returned from `useForm`\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\n### TOnMount\n\n`TOnMount` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnChange\n\n`TOnChange` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnChangeAsync\n\n`TOnChangeAsync` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormAsyncValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnBlur\n\n`TOnBlur` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnBlurAsync\n\n`TOnBlurAsync` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormAsyncValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnSubmit\n\n`TOnSubmit` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnSubmitAsync\n\n`TOnSubmitAsync` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormAsyncValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnDynamic\n\n`TOnDynamic` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnDynamicAsync\n\n`TOnDynamicAsync` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormAsyncValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TOnServer\n\n`TOnServer` *extends* `undefined` \\| `FormAsyncValidateOrFn`\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\n### TSubmitMeta\n\n`TSubmitMeta`\n\n## Properties\n\n### Field\n\n```ts\nField: FieldComponent<TFormData, TOnMount, TOnChange, TOnChangeAsync, TOnBlur, TOnBlurAsync, TOnSubmit, TOnSubmitAsync, TOnDynamic, TOnDynamicAsync, TOnServer, TSubmitMeta>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx:41](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx#L41)\n\nA Preact component to render form fields. With this, you can render and manage individual form fields.\n\n***\n\n### FormGroup\n\n```ts\nFormGroup: FormGroupComponent<TFormData, TOnMount, TOnChange, TOnChangeAsync, TOnBlur, TOnBlurAsync, TOnSubmit, TOnSubmitAsync, TOnDynamic, TOnDynamicAsync, TOnServer, TSubmitMeta>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx:55](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx#L55)\n\n***\n\n### Subscribe()\n\n```ts\nSubscribe: <TSelected>(props) => ComponentChildren;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx:72](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/useForm.tsx#L72)\n\nA `Subscribe` function that allows you to listen and react to changes in the form's state. It's especially useful when you need to execute side effects or render specific components in response to state updates.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = `NoInfer`\\<`FormState`\\<`TFormData`, `TOnMount`, `TOnChange`, `TOnChangeAsync`, `TOnBlur`, `TOnBlurAsync`, `TOnSubmit`, `TOnSubmitAsync`, `TOnDynamic`, `TOnDynamicAsync`, `TOnServer`\\>\\>\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### props\n\n###### children\n\n`ComponentChild` \\| (`state`) => `ComponentChild`\n\n###### selector?\n\n(`state`) => `TSelected`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`ComponentChildren`\n"}
